### Slack API Integration

#### [MODIFY] [src/platforms/slack-api.js](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Slack_Discord_ClickUp_Drive/src/platforms/slack-api.js)
Add helper functions to:
- Delete a Slack message by [ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Slack_Discord_ClickUp_Drive/test-clickup-statuses.js#12-40).
- Send initial top-level messages to a channel without threading logic (to generate the thread entry point constraint).

## Verification Plan
1. Send a manual `taskCreated` payload and ensure Slack receives the base message and the [SyncConfigs](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Slack_Discord_ClickUp_Drive/src/nocodb.js#76-83) record initializes successfully.
2. Send a manual `taskUpdated` payload moving the status to `CLIENT_REVIEW` and observe the automated ping inside the thread. 
3. Send a manual `taskDeleted` payload and confirm the thread is nuked from Slack and NocoDB is clean.
